OL,3,GNEWSABikers gather for service of
OL,4,Aremembrance
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of people, many of them
OL,7,Farriving on motorbikes, have gathered
OL,8,Fin Staffordshire to remember those who
OL,9,Fdied for their country.
OL,11,FThe 19th annual Ride to the Wall was
OL,12,Fthe first big event to have taken place
OL,13,Fat the Royal British Legion Remembrance
OL,14,FGardens since its name change, which
OL,15,Fsparked controversy last week.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,359,350,200,160,0,100
PN,35802
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F358A1791051923
OL,1,W5j 5Q7+ js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,$A(W)
OL,3,GNEWSABikers gather for service of
OL,4,Aremembrance
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt was formerly known as the National
OL,7,FMemorial Arboretum and thousands of
OL,8,Fpeople had signed a petition opposing
OL,9,Fthe change on the grounds it
OL,10,F"undermines its rich heritage and the
OL,11,Fdeep emotional connections many have
OL,12,Fwith it".
OL,14,FBut most people taking part in the Ride
OL,15,Fto the Wall, which ended with a service
OL,16,Fof remembrance at the gardens, said
OL,17,Fthey were not concerned by the new
OL,18,Fname.
